  "headline": "God of War Sons of Sparta dev interview details the project’s origin goals",
  "description": "A 2026-02-16 PlayStation Blog interview with Mega Cat Studios adds new context on how God of War Sons of Sparta connects to Kratos’s earlier era.",
  "articleBody": "On 2026-02-16, PlayStation Blog published a developer interview with Mega Cat Studios focused on God of War Sons of Sparta. The interview frames the game as a 2D action project that intentionally links back to Kratos’s earlier timeline while keeping modern onboarding in mind.\n\nPlayStation Blog’s earlier 2026-02-13 explainer remains the key reference for what players should expect at launch-level scope, including platform and core gameplay positioning. Together, the two official posts provide a clearer split between confirmed gameplay basics and broader creative intent.\n\nAt this stage, only details explicitly published in those official posts should be treated as confirmed. Any additional release specifics should wait for formal announcements.\n\n- Sources:\n  - https://blog.playstation.com/2026/02/16/god-of-war-sons-of-sparta-mega-cat-studios-discuss-origins-of-kratos-and-companys-name/\n  - https://blog.playstation.com/2026/02/13/god-of-war-sons-of-sparta-what-you-need-to-know/",
